  "historyNote": "#2396, eff 6-30-83; amd by #2437, eff 8-1-83; ss by #2920, eff 12-4-84, EXPIRED: 12-4-90 New. #9206, eff 7-19-08; ss by #9549, eff 10-1-09; ss by #10677, eff 9-26-14, EXPIRED: 9-26-24 New. #14125, INTERIM, eff 11-26-25, EXPIRES: 5-25-25 (Remains in effect per RSA 541-A:14-a); ss by #14274, eff 6-24-25, EXPIRES: 6-24-35",
